<title>UK: Statkraft sets 400 mln Danish crown Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Statkraft sets 400 mln Danish crown Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Dan Danske Bank and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATKRAFT F/S OF OSLO</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.74    PAY DATE  L-19.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NORWAY    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
